### MultiSig Validator Service API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:3002

# =============================================================================
# HEALTH & STATUS ENDPOINTS
# =============================================================================

### Get API Information
GET http://localhost:3002/api/

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3002/api/health

### Service Metrics
GET http://localhost:3002/api/metrics

### Detailed Status
GET http://localhost:3002/api/status

# =============================================================================
# WALLET MANAGEMENT ENDPOINTS
# =============================================================================

### List All Wallets
GET http://localhost:3002/api/wallets

### List Wallets for Specific Network
GET http://localhost:3002/api/wallets?network=localhost

### Add Wallet (Localhost - MultiSig)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512",
  "network": "localhost",
  "name": "Localhost MultiSig Wallet",
  "type": "MultiSigWallet"
}

### Add Wallet (MultiSig with Daily Limit)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0x9fE46736679d2D9a65F0992F2272dE9f3c7fa6e0",
  "network": "localhost",
  "name": "Localhost MultiSig with Daily Limit",
  "type": "MultiSigWalletWithDailyLimit"
}

### Add Wallet (Sepolia Network)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0x1234567890123456789012345678901234567890",
  "network": "sepolia",
  "name": "Sepolia MultiSig Wallet",
  "type": "MultiSigWallet"
}

### Add Wallet (Auto-detect Contract Type)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512",
  "network": "localhost",
  "name": "Auto-detected Wallet"
}

### Get Specific Wallet Details
GET http://localhost:3002/api/wallets/0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512?network=localhost

### Remove Wallet
DELETE http://localhost:3002/api/wallets/0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512?network=localhost

# =============================================================================
# ERROR TESTING ENDPOINTS
# =============================================================================

### Test Invalid Address Format
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "invalid-address",
  "network": "localhost",
  "name": "Invalid Address Test"
}

### Test Missing Required Fields
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512"
}

### Test Invalid Network
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512",
  "network": "invalid-network",
  "name": "Invalid Network Test"
}

### Test Unmonitored Network (when MONITORED_NETWORKS=localhost)
POST http://localhost:3002/api/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address": "0xe7f1725E7734CE288F8367e1Bb143E90bb3F0512",
  "network": "mainnet",
  "name": "Unmonitored Network Test"
}

